Good afternoon,

 Upon review, we found that we'd incorrectly noted the number of lifts in our original note. This resulted in our outlining 2 lifts for $522, when the work performed was truly 3 lifts for $783. I apologize for this error on our part.

I'm attaching the relevant reports to demonstrate the basis for the 3 lifts. These reports were transmitted on 03/5/2026 to Montana Grove.

Could you please provide an EPO to cover this short fall, so we may be compensated for the remaining $261?

Thank you in advance for your assistance.



[cid:image001.png@01DCE2EB.75F78560]



Kind regards,

